body:
As per quarkus docs I added the openapi docs into `src/main/webui/` and for the time being I think this is ok to have the generated spec in the repository, in the future, we may refactor quinoa and oval to use the target folder.

I am not a UI expert.. I am open to comments (best practices, naming convention..).

The usage of the generated stub is the following, for example, tools list
```
  getApiV1ManagementTargetsToolsList().then((response) => {
    // Update the model with the response
    ...
  });
  ```
